    examPath: '/examen/rayo-de-luz-test',
    intro: 'A physics game to understand the law of reflection hands-on: there is a laser, a sensor and some mirrors tilted at 45° that you turn with a tap. The goal is to get the beam to the sensor. Every time the beam bounces, the normal of the mirror is drawn, and when you solve it the two equal angles appear: the incoming one and the outgoing one.',
