    emoji: '🔭', gradient: 'from-indigo-500 to-violet-700', path: '/juegos/escala-universo',
    intro: 'A powers and scientific notation game where you place, move and write. On a powers-of-10 ruler running from a hydrogen atom to the Milky Way you place each object on its mark, knowing each mark is ten times the previous one. With “move the point” you take a number like 12,700,000 to 1.27 × 10⁷ (or back), watching the exponent make up for each step. And with the laws of powers you adjust the exponent of a product, a quotient or a power of a power, type the value of 5⁰, 2⁻³ or (−2)³ and, on hard, calculate in scientific notation and normalise the result.',
